WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,790 --> 00:00:06,050
Three hundred thousand something?

2
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:08,500
tell me what you know

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:09,500
Three hundred thousand in cash

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,500
Give money first

5
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:11,500
You speak again

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:17,690
before 10 p.m.

7
00:00:17,690 --> 00:00:20,970
I'll contact your brother

8
00:00:20,970 --> 00:00:21,970
How do you know he really knows?

9
00:00:21,970 --> 00:00:24,800
He is the only clerk at Yunfeng Milk Tea

10
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,800
Totally unaware

11
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:27,800
He doesn't need to be so afraid

12
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:30,440
Be willing to shut up for Yang Feng

13
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:39,990
It’s just that I didn’t give enough money.

14
00:00:39,990 --> 00:00:40,990
And bringing so many people with me
